      "question": "Statements: No bank is a cooperative. Some cooperatives are societies. All societies are regulated. Conclusions: I. Some cooperatives are regulated. II. Some banks may be regulated.",
      "questionHtml": "Statements:<br />\nNo bank is a cooperative.<br />\nSome cooperatives are societies.<br />\nAll societies are regulated.<br />\nConclusions:<br />\nI. Some cooperatives are regulated.<br />\nII. Some banks may be regulated.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Only I follows",
          "html": "Only I follows"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Only II follows",
          "html": "Only II follows"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Both I and II follow",
          "html": "Both I and II follow"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Neither I nor II follows",
          "html": "Neither I nor II follows"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage69de61b9bfc62621a2726fd8.png\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">I. Some cooperatives are regulated. → True (As, Some cooperatives are societies and All societies are regulated → Some cooperatives are regulated)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">II. Some banks may be regulated. → True (As, there is no direct relation between bank and regulated, so it is a possibility which is always true.)</p>\n",
      "images": [
