      "question": "A series is given with one term wrong. Select that wrong term from the given alternatives. MAL1300, KDH1114, IGD928, GJZ742, FLW556, CPR370",
      "questionHtml": "<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">A series is given with one term wrong. Select that wrong term from the given alternatives.<br />\nMAL1300, KDH1114, IGD928, GJZ742, FLW556, CPR370</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "CPR370",
          "html": "<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">CPR370</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "FLW556",
          "html": "<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">FLW556</span>"
        },
