      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage6a15daa6d79f736050b3ecc3.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>Logic followed here is: Each term in the series consists of three letters followed by a number. The letters follow specific arithmetic progressions based on their alphabetical positions, and the numbers decrease by a constant value.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage6a2a7297b5643c65886bbd6f.png\" /></p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<p>The pattern observed for the 5th term is that it should be <strong>EMV556</strong> instead of <strong>FLW556</strong>.</p>\n\n<p>Therefore, the wrong term in the series is <strong>FLW556</strong>.</p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is <strong>&quot;Option 2&quot;.</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [
