      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p> </p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><strong>Logic:</strong> The relationship between the figures is based on the diagonal movement of the internal symbols. Each symbol moves to its diagonally opposite corner in the subsequent figure.</span></p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage6a185469264fd1ad95102ac4.png\" /></p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-a6b12a6b-7fff-0a83-34d9-86401a1ecac2\"><span style=\" font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Similarly,</span></span></p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage6a18546a264fd1ad95102b32.png\" /></p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Thus, option 1 is the missing figure on the right side of (::) from the given alternatives based on the same logic/rule/relation.</span></p>\n",
