      "question": "A series is given with one term missing. Select the correct alternative from the given ones that will complete the series. 16, 35, 74, 151, 306, 615, 1234, ?",
      "questionHtml": "A series is given with one term missing. Select the correct alternative from the given ones that will complete the series.<br />\n16, 35, 74, 151, 306, 615, 1234, ?",
      "options": [
