      "solution": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 1.38;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Logic:</span> a $ b = (a + b)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span></span></p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 1.38;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">1. </span>3 $ 4 = 81 <span id=\"docs-internal-guid-f53a8148-7fff-4fd3-0732-70d6a9572506\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">→ (3 + 4)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> = 7<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> = 49 </span></span><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-c15c0a98-7fff-0969-057e-78b8759dbe96\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">≠ 81</span></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> </span></p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 1.38;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Thus, '</span>3 $ 4 = 81' is the odd one out.</p>\n",
