      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Time = Distance / Speed</span><br style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\" />\n<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">= 200 ÷ (500/18)</span><br style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\" />\n<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">= 200 × (18/500)</span><br style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\" />\n<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">= 7.2 seconds</span>",
