    {
      "id": "ca9a0e27bdfe-q22",
      "number": 22,
      "question": "In a line of 60 people, Suresh is 22nd from the front and Mahesh is 18th from the back. How many people are standing between Suresh and Mahesh?",
      "questionHtml": "In a line of 60 people, Suresh is 22nd from the front and Mahesh is 18th from the back. How many people are standing between Suresh and Mahesh?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "19",
          "html": "19"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "20",
          "html": "20"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "21",
          "html": "21"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "22",
          "html": "22"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>Given:</p>\n\n<p>Total number of people in the line = 60</p>\n\n<p>Suresh is 22<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">nd</span> from the front.</p>\n\n<p>Mahesh is 18<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">th</span> from the back.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Convert Mahesh&rsquo;s position from the front:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Position from front = Total people - Position from back + 1</p>\n\n<p>= 60 - 18 + 1</p>\n\n<p>= 43</p>\n\n<p>So, Mahesh is 43<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">rd</span> from the front.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Now, number of people between Suresh and Mahesh:</strong></p>\n\n<p>= 43 - 22 - 1</p>\n\n<p>= 21 - 1</p>\n\n<p><strong>= 20</strong></p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is <strong>&quot;Option 2&quot;</strong>.</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
