      "question": "Direction: Choose the correct options from the alternative- 1101 : 1011 :: 2125:?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Direction: Choose the correct options from the alternative-</p>\n\n<p>1101 : 1011 :: 2125:?</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "5122",
          "html": "<p>5122</p>\n"
        },
        {
